      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "NOVA INTENTION (2) has raced below best last couple, the latest managing only 6th (25.09) last time in a Mix 6/7 at Sale. Has never missed the frame here at the trip including one win. Ready to return to form. PAW VITALI (3) was safely held last time out, finishing fifth at Ballarat over 390m behind Super Stitch (22.89) in a T3 Grade 6. Should be in this for a long way. HOLLY HOOK (8) took the sit on the lead from an outside box but levelled up and drew clear to score (24.61) at Traralgon in a T3 RSTW over 425m. Has won two of four starts from this draw. Likely to be in the finish. MY LITTLE FLOSS (6) has strong claims after a long-odds top-three finish last time out.",
